# (via kernelUpgradeTheory.candle_kernel_sound). Tier 2: needs the built
# CakeML candle chain. Mirrors kernel/Holmakefile's candle wiring + the
# svenvs selfprover/kernel layers. NO $(CAKEMLDIR) root (weakeningTheory
